bridge('ECON-NL-IMPORTS-EXPORTS-NX-6004','A household buys an imported appliance for$500 and pays a domestic installer$100. Both payments enter consumption. How much does this transaction add to domestic GDP after the import offset?', ['$100','$600','$500','$0'], 'Consumption rises600, but imports subtract500 through NX. The domestic installation100 remains in GDP.','Includes the imported appliance without its NX cancellation.',('600-500',100))
